<title>INDIA: India's ITC 1996/97 net seen up 42 pct.</title>
<headline>India's ITC 1996/97 net seen up 42 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tobacco conglomerate ITC Ltd's net profit is forecast to rise 42.36 percent to 3.7 billion rupees in the year ended March 31, 1997, a Reuter poll of leading 28 leading securities and brokerage firms showed.</p>
<p>Analysts' projections ranged from 3.1 billion rupees to 4.5 billion rupees against 2.6 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>ITC is an associate of B.A.T Industries Plc.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>ITC  ----PAT seen up 42.36%, sales up 14.20%</p>
<p>		     Net profit   1995/96    Net sales   1995/96</p>
<p>				(in million rupees)</p>
<p>Average		3,715.50   2,610.00   28,957.04   25,357.20</p>
<p>High		   4,496.00		  31,151.00</p>
<p>Low		    3,102.50		  25,659.00</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
